---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Work — LucrumTech"
  description="Six products shipped, every one still in production — AI platforms, industrial automation, enterprise systems and digital products."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work</p>
      <h1>Six products shipped. Every one still in production.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:22px">AI platforms, industrial automation, enterprise systems and digital products.</p>

      <div class="workitem">
        <span class="tag">Insurance / AI</span><h3>InHelper</h3>
        <div class="row"><b>The problem</b><p>Insurance case processing depended on manual document handling and manual reporting. A single case took days, and the load fell on people who should have been assessing claims.</p></div>
        <div class="row"><b>What we owned</b><p>The full platform — architecture through delivery. PDF parsing, call transcription, structured data extraction and automated report generation in one workflow.</p></div>
        <div class="row"><b>What changed</b><p>Processing dropped from days to hours. Reporting accuracy improved and administrative workload fell.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="workitem">
        <span class="tag">Industrial automation</span><h3>AMOS</h3>
        <div class="row"><b>The problem</b><p>Changing automation on a production line was slow and expensive, so the manufacturer effectively couldn't experiment. Every adjustment carried a changeover cost that made iteration uneconomic.</p></div>
        <div class="row"><b>What we owned</b><p>An automation operating layer over a cloud IoT backbone. Engineering teams deploy workflow changes to live production systems remotely, adjust logic against real equipment, and monitor execution cycles as they run.</p></div>
        <div class="row"><b>What changed</b><p>Faster deployment, less downtime, better operational visibility. Experimentation that had been too costly became routine.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="workitem">
        <span class="tag">Manufacturing</span><h3>Order-to-Execution</h3>
        <div class="row"><b>The problem</b><p>Production orders were typed into specialised equipment by hand. Manual entry meant delays and recurring errors on the factory floor.</p></div>
        <div class="row"><b>What we owned</b><p>A Windows-based automation system that takes validated orders and translates product configurations, sizing specifications and machine parameters directly into machine-ready instructions.</p></div>
        <div class="row"><b>What changed</b><p>Manual operator input was eliminated from the order path, errors fell, and production workflows ran faster.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="workitem">
        <span class="tag">IoT / analytics</span><h3>Machine Monitoring</h3>
        <div class="row"><b>The problem</b><p>Most machines on the floor weren't connected to any network. There was no way to see alerts, warnings or throughput without standing in front of the equipment.</p></div>
        <div class="row"><b>What we owned</b><p>A monitoring system using IoT cameras to read machine screen output directly — no retrofit, no machine integration — converting alerts and operational indicators into structured analytics.</p></div>
        <div class="row"><b>What changed</b><p>Failures get caught earlier, downtime fell, and operations gained visibility into equipment that had been invisible.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="workitem">
        <span class="tag">AdTech / AI</span><h3>WhatIf</h3>
        <div class="row"><b>What it is</b><p>An AI analytics platform for installation advertising — campaign performance analysis, behaviour pattern recognition, conversion analytics and automated recommendations.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="workitem">
        <span class="tag">Communications</span><h3>nuMessage</h3>
        <div class="row"><b>What it is</b><p>A secure communication platform — encrypted messaging and voice on a privacy-first architecture.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="btnrow"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Building something similar? Book a call</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
